    <entry>
      <name>Data Staging Pipeline Error Log</name>
      <description/>
      <type>WRITE_TO_LOG</type>
      <attributes/>
      <logmessage>================================================================================
[MASTER JOB FAILURE] Execution Stopped: Data Staging Pipeline
Timestamp: ${Internal.Job.Execution.Date}
Job: ${Internal.Job.Name}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Problem Description:
The primary ingestion and staging sub-job encountered an unrecoverable error. 
Telemetry data, batch records, or tariff inputs could not be processed 
and stored into the PostgreSQL (NeonDB) database.

Downstream Impact:
The subsequent step (Generate Report) has been cancelled to prevent producing 
inaccurate or incomplete business reports.

Probable Root Causes:
1. Source files missing or malformed (CSV, JSON telemetry, or Energy Tariffs XML).
2. Database connectivity failure or schema constraint violation on NeonDB.
3. Transformation failure inside the sub-job pipeline.

Action:
Review the specific error log generated within the Data Staging Pipeline sub-job.
================================================================================</logmessage>
      <loglevel>Error</loglevel>
      <logsubject>[CLAYSENSE ETL MASTER] - Data Staging Pipeline Failed</logsubject>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <draw>Y</draw>
      <nr>0</nr>
      <xloc>512</xloc>
      <yloc>224</yloc>
      <attributes_kjc/>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <name>Generate Report Error Log</name>
      <description/>
      <type>WRITE_TO_LOG</type>
      <attributes/>
      <logmessage>================================================================================
[MASTER JOB FAILURE] Execution Stopped: Generate Report
Timestamp: ${Internal.Job.Execution.Date}
Job: ${Internal.Job.Name}
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Problem Description:
Data staging and database ingestion completed successfully, but the secondary 
sub-job responsible for generating Excel workbooks and dispatching alert 
emails failed.

Downstream Impact:
Aggregated production data is persisted in NeonDB, but operational supervisors 
have not received scheduled reports or anomaly notifications.

Probable Root Causes:
1. Excel template/export failure in Report Export Transformation.
2. SMTP connection or authentication timeout during email dispatch.
3. File movement error into the archive or sent_reports directory.

Action:
Inspect the Generate Report sub-job logs for exact details on whether 
the failure occurred during Excel export, email delivery, or file archiving.
================================================================================</logmessage>
      <loglevel>Error</loglevel>
      <logsubject>[CLAYSENSE ETL MASTER] - Report Generation Sub-Job Failed</logsubject>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <draw>Y</draw>
      <nr>0</nr>
      <xloc>672</xloc>
      <yloc>224</yloc>
      <attributes_kjc/>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <name>Abort job</name>
      <description/>
      <type>ABORT</type>
      <attributes/>
      <message>There was an error during the transformation</message>
      <parallel>N</parallel>
      <draw>Y</draw>
      <nr>0</nr>
      <xloc>592</xloc>
      <yloc>96</yloc>
      <attributes_kjc/>
    </entry>
